// SECTION 20AI: V10.14 PRIVATE SECTOR SIMULATION — COMPANIES • PRODUCTION • SUPPLY CHAINS • REGIONAL ECOSYSTEMS
// ============================================================================
// Interpretation layer only. Private firms are derived abstractions — never turn actors, never hold wallets,
// never buy/sell canonical inventory, and never override V10.1 industry production/supply authority.
// Companies read Living Regions sectors, V10.1 industries & dependencies, V10.2 corridor context (when present),
// and V10.8 economic geography clusters. Values are game-abstraction points, not real corporate or GDP data.
//
// Ownership (Invariants A–P):
//  - V10.1 remains authoritative for strategic supply, production points, flows and bottlenecks.
//  - Living Regions remains authoritative for regional economy/development/momentum.
//  - V10.8 remains authoritative for cluster competition; V10.14 interprets private ecosystem maturity.
//  - Player/AI actors interact only through existing actions; private sector reacts via World Reaction roots.

